{"asset_key":"ep6/gameplay_story_16600100","episode":"ep6","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"16600100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1660010001:1":{"text":"オクサーナを支えながら、市場の一角へやってきた。彼女の目尻がかすかに潤んでいる。きっとここには、彼女の思い出がたくさん詰まっているのだろう。","source_cn":"你们搀扶着奥克萨娜来到了集市一角。奥克萨娜的眼角微微湿...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDD2CA1463D739341","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"オクサーナを支えながら、市場の一角へやってきた。彼女の目尻がかすかに潤んでいる。きっとここには、彼女の思い出がたくさん詰まっているのだろう。","female":"オクサーナを支えながら、市場の一角へやってきた。彼女の目尻がかすかに潤んでいる。きっとここには、彼女の思い出がたくさん詰まっているのだろう。","variant_male_record_index":"204923","variant_female_record_index":"204924","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1660010002:1":{"text":"昔はねえ、村の女の子たちと市場の入口で、手作りの花冠を売っていたのよ。","source_cn":"以前啊，我和村里的女孩们，总在集市的入口这里，售卖自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F17C635DF9544D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1660010003:1":{"text":"このドレスも、その時着ていたの。あの時は、ボタンもちゃんとついてたのよ。","source_cn":"这件裙装，就是那时候穿的，当时裙装上的扣子还没有掉呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC0A16E726D46572","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1660010004:1":{"text":"ある日の夕方、変なお客さんがやってきてねえ……花冠を渡したときに、グレイヴボーンだって気付いたの。","source_cn":"那天傍晚时分，来了一个奇怪的顾客，我将花环递给他时，才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA96EF70C81F56112","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1660010005:1":{"text":"怖くなかったのかい？","source_cn":"你不害怕吗？<key:dialog7>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F21EE4C063D0631","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1660010006:0":{"text":"そうねえ、でも彼の方が私よりも怖がっていたから。彼の悲しそうで驚いた顔を見たとき、私はただ呆然とするしかなかったわ。","source_cn":"当时他脸上的神情，比我更害怕。那种惊讶又悲伤的样子……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8372BB42079D02B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1660010007:1":{"text":"そして気付いたら、彼は花冠を残して、杉林の奥に逃げていったの。","source_cn":"没等我反应过来，他就丢下了花环，躲回了雪松林的深处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34B8CA55FA225F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1660010008:1":{"text":"でもね、あれから毎朝、私の家の窓辺に一輪のお花が置かれるようになったのよ。彼なりの、お詫びのつもりだったのでしょうね……","source_cn":"从那以后，每天清晨，我的窗台上都会放着一枝最新鲜的花，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x270E95121D7EA6D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1660010009:1":{"text":"そしてある夜、花を置きに来た彼を待ち伏せして、思い切って姿を見せたの。そこから、私とギリルの出会いが始まったのよ。","source_cn":"终于，在一个晚上，我趁着他来放花的时候，出现在了他面前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2C3100A15AD30C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1660010009":{"